        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For Sale by Online Auction Thursday, 29 October 2026\n\nPRISTINE TWO-BEDROOM APARTMENT WITH BALCONY OVERLOOKING BELTURBET GOLF CLUB \n\nSmith Property presents for sale by online auction this pristine two-bedroom apartment, complete with a balcony overlooking Belturbet Golf Club.\n\nExtending to approximately 837 sq. ft. (77.8 sq. m.), the apartment is presented in excellent condition throughout. The balcony provides an inviting outdoor space to relax and enjoy the golf course views.\n\nSituated in an excellent location in Belturbet, within easy reach of Cavan town, this property will appeal to a range of purchasers, including first-time buyers, investors and those seeking to downsize to a more manageable home.\n\nFor investors, an estimated rental income of 1,050 per month equates to 12,600 gross per annum, before management charges, maintenance, vacancy periods and other outgoings. This estimate is subject to confirmation of the achievable and permitted rent.\n\nKey Features\n\n\nTwo-bedroom apartment presented in pristine condition.\n\n\nAccommodation extending to approximately 837 sq. ft. (77.8 sq. m.).\n\n\nBalcony overlooking Belturbet Golf Club.\n\n\nExcellent location within easy reach of Cavan town.\nSuitable for first-time buyers, investors and purchasers seeking to downsize.\n\n\nEstimated gross annual rental income of 12,600.\n\nAuction Information\n\n\nOnline Auction: Thursday, 29 October 2026\n\nAuction Platform: Offr\n\nBidder Security Deposit: 1,000\n\nRegistration Deadline: 5:00 p.m. on Wednesday, 28 October 2026\n\nPlease familiarise yourself with the auction process before bidding.\n\nA 1,000 bidder security deposit, together with the applicable registration fee, must be paid in advance to enable bidding on the day of the auction. If unsuccessful, the 1,000 bidder security deposit will be fully refunded.\n\nIf you are the successful bidder, you will become immediately contracted upon the fall of the hammer, and the non-refundable balance of the 10% contract deposit must be paid immediately.\n\nInterested bidders must pre-register a minimum of 24 hours before the auction. Registration can be completed through the Offr widget on the property listing on our website. Bidders must meet both the minimum advance-registration requirement and the stated registration deadline.\n\nProspective bidders should also register through their Offr account to access the legal documents. All legal documents may not be available for download until closer to the auction date. Once registered, you will receive an alert when further documents become available.\n\nWe strongly recommend that all prospective purchasers arrange for their solicitor to review the legal documents before bidding.\n\nFor further particulars, viewing arrangements and auction registration assistance, please contact Smith Property.\n\nImportant Notice\n\n\nThese particulars do not constitute a formal offer. They are provided for information purposes only and are intended to give a general description of the property. They shall not form any part of a resulting contract and should not be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.\n\nWhile every care has been taken in their preparation, neither Smith Property nor the vendor accepts any liability for their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves, by inspection or otherwise, as to the correctness of these particulars.\n\nNo person employed by Smith Property has authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatsoever in relation to this property."
      },
